# Charged ollie, Indy grab (L + right) held about half a second: more points the longer it is held.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold grab+right 93..95
hold grab 95..150
run 320
expect event trickEnd{trick=Indy} within 140..190
expect event comboLanded within 160..240
expect no event bail
